  "notes": [
    "Asset geometry is newly drawn at HD resolution; old textures are neither enlarged nor sampled.",
    "Item and upgrade use the same approved paper stock geometry; category identity remains runtime illustration/text.",
    "Bilinear, Clamp, no mipmaps, FullRect; normal surfaces 512 square, PPU200 and L/B/R/T border32.",
    "Progress strips 768x96 with L/B/R/T border48/0/48/0; Filled/Simple consumers must set preserveAspect=false; fillAmount remains runtime-owned.",
    "Focus frame is white RGB with alpha; works with LocalFx material/Graphic tint. Slots have fully transparent inner area and no baked capacity or ordinal.",
    "Palette sprites use Color.white; neutral/white-alpha sprites accept runtime tint. Reset fillCenter correctly on pooled Images.",
    "Source preview is a Pillow slice simulation at canvas reference PPU100; it does not prove Unity runtime appearance or input behavior."
  ]
}
